==[ Packaging ]

Nix is the packaging story.
@file("nix/pkgs/tomet.nix") and @file("nix/pkgs/vscode-extension.nix") build the CLI and the VS Code extension; @file(nix/dev.nix) is the dev shell.

==[ Finding your way around ]

- Crate layers and the dependency direction between them: the `crate-layering` entry in @file(".writ.tmt").
- What a crate is and why it exists: that crate's `//!` module doc and @dir(tmtroot/generated/crates/).
- What a crate depends on: its @file("Cargo.toml").
- What the CLI does: `tomet --help`.

